        <h1>The Return of @infinite_words</h1>
        <p>It only took me, like, three years, but I&#8217;ve got the <a href="https://twitter.com/infinite_words">@infinite_words</a> account running again.</p>

<p>The <a href="http://philbencomo.com/2011/10/infinite_words">previous iteration</a> of my <em>Infinite Jest</em> word-a-day bot survived for a year and a half, until changes to the Twitter API killed it. I still received cron notifications in my inbox with the day&#8217;s word and an error message, nagging me every day at 12:10 p.m. to update it.</p>

<p>On this rainy Sunday, using a <a href="http://www.zachwhalen.net/posts/how-to-make-a-twitter-bot-with-google-spreadsheets-version-04/">quick-and-dirty tool</a> by Zach Whalen, I finally did.</p>

